<p>The Senate convened at 10:00am.</p>



<p>Confirmed, 49-43: Confirmation of Executive Calendar #968, Richard Wesley Bennett to be United States District Judge for the Southern District of Texas.</p>



<p>Invoked, 49-43: Motion to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #969, Courtney Leigh Coker to be United States District Judge for the Northern District of Texas.</p>



<p>Adopted by unanimous consent: S.Res.967, Honoring the life and legacy of Fiona the Hippopotamus.</p>



<p>Confirmed, 49-41: Confirmation of Executive Calendar #969, Courtney Leigh Coker to be United States District Judge for the Northern District of Texas.</p>



<p>Invoked, 55-31: Motion to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #970, Kyle Frederick Reardon to be United States District Judge for the District of Alaska.</p>



<p>Invoked, 48-36: Motion to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #967, Daniel Lewis Ballou to be United States District Judge for the Eastern District of Kentucky.</p>



<p>Invoked, 47-35: Motion to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #977, Robert E. Long, Jr. to be United States District Judge for the Middle District of Florida.</p>



<p>Invoked, 45-33: Motion to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #979, Jesus A. Osete to be United States District Judge for the Western District of Missouri.</p>



<p>The Senate adjourned at 5:13pm.</p>
